#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Install Qiskit Runtime {#install-qiskit-runtime}"
msgstr "Pasang Qiskit Runtime {#install-qiskit-runtime}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Follow these steps to install Qiskit Runtime:\n"
msgstr "Ikuti langkah-langkah ini untuk memasang Qiskit Runtime:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Clone the Qiskit Runtime repository.\n"
msgstr "Klon repositori Qiskit Runtime.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Change to the `qiskit-ibm-runtime` directory.\n"
msgstr "Tukar ke direktori `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Install `qiskit-runtime`. We recommend using a [virtual "
"environment](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html) to avoid polluting"
" your global Python installation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pasang `qiskit-runtime`. Kami syorkan menggunakan [persekitaran "
"maya](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html) untuk mengelakkan "
"pencemaran pemasangan Python global anda.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Standard install**:\n"
msgstr "**Pemasangan standard**:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install .\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install .\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Editable mode**: In this mode, you don't need to reinstall Qiskit when "
"there are code changes to the project.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Mod boleh sunting**: Dalam mod ini, anda tidak perlu memasang semula "
"Qiskit apabila ada perubahan kod pada projek.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install -e .\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install -e .\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    In editable mode, the compiled extensions are built in _debug mode_ "
"without optimizations.\n"
msgstr ""
"    Dalam mod boleh sunting, sambungan yang dikompil dibina dalam _mod "
"nyahpepijat_ tanpa pengoptimuman.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(Optional) If you want to run tests or linting checks, install the developer"
" requirements. We recommend using a [virtual "
"environment](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html) to avoid polluting"
" your global Python installation.\n"
msgstr ""
"(Pilihan) Jika anda ingin menjalankan ujian atau semakan linting, pasang "
"keperluan pembangun. Kami syorkan menggunakan [persekitaran "
"maya](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html) untuk mengelakkan "
"pencemaran pemasangan Python global anda.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah seterusnya {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  - Read the [contributing guidelines](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) to contribute to `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"  - [Install the Qiskit SDK from source](/guides/install-qiskit-source).\n"
"  - [Run your first program](/guides/hello-world).\n"
"  - Try a tutorial, such as [Grover's algorithm](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Cadangan\">\n"
"  - Baca [panduan sumbangan](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) untuk menyumbang kepada `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"  - [Pasang Qiskit SDK dari sumber](/guides/install-qiskit-source).\n"
"  - [Jalankan program pertama anda](/guides/hello-world).\n"
"  - Cuba tutorial, seperti [Algoritma Grover](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
